+
+**The second defect (empty turn stdout) is also real and also inert.** Corpus-wide it hit **6 runs /
+10 turns**, every one **openai** (5 of the 6 in `8rugb`; the other `threeknob/val-tk-sol-high-s3-03`)
+-- broader than the single run 8rugb reported. It can only touch `d_evidence`, the one dimension of
